WEBVTT

00:01.630 --> 00:03.630
<i>Somehow
we survived our mad dive</i>

00:03.800 --> 00:05.260
<i>into the canyons of Oban,</i>

00:05.420 --> 00:08.340
<i>but what we ran into
was even scarier than death.</i>

00:08.550 --> 00:11.090
<i>A dark land filled
with evil magic,</i>

00:11.260 --> 00:12.970
<i>and home of the Creators,</i>

00:13.140 --> 00:16.350
<i>strange creatures who claim to be
the ancient masters of Oban.</i>

00:16.560 --> 00:19.520
<i>If what they say is true,
then we've been tricked, big time.</i>

00:19.810 --> 00:21.940
<i>The secret behind
the Great Race of Oban</i>

00:22.110 --> 00:25.730
<i>could be far more mysterious
than any of us ever imagined.</i>

01:37.310 --> 01:42.730
Proud pilots, the Great Race
of Oban is soon coming to an end.

01:43.520 --> 01:46.690
I know it has claimed
a heavy toll among you,

01:47.070 --> 01:50.360
but let not the tragic
disappearances of Sul

01:50.530 --> 01:53.740
and the Earth team
distract you from your goal.

01:54.030 --> 01:57.450
Today you face off
for the last time.

01:58.370 --> 02:02.830
Prepare yourself for a long
and challenging final race,

02:03.000 --> 02:06.250
in which the winners' points
will be doubled.

02:06.960 --> 02:11.300
This is your last chance
to win the Ultimate Prize.

02:12.010 --> 02:14.380
Do not let it slip
through your fingers.

02:14.550 --> 02:16.720
But what is
the Ultimate Prize?

02:19.850 --> 02:20.520
Molly!

02:23.600 --> 02:27.690
I am pleased to see you are
back among us, young human,

02:27.940 --> 02:31.320
but far less
that you dare to interrupt me!

02:33.320 --> 02:37.030
I meant no disrespect,
but what is the Ultimate Prize?

02:37.320 --> 02:38.410
I need to know!

02:38.580 --> 02:40.410
You have been told.

02:40.620 --> 02:43.330
Are you doubting
the word of the Avatar?

02:46.500 --> 02:49.500
The Creators told us the Ultimate Prize
won't grant our wishes.

02:50.050 --> 02:51.210
The Creators?

02:51.710 --> 02:54.760
Yeah, the ancient masters
of Oban.

02:54.930 --> 02:56.470
Does that ring any bells?

02:57.090 --> 02:59.100
We had a little chat with them
in a weird temple.

03:02.310 --> 03:04.140
They said the real purpose
of the race

03:04.310 --> 03:06.520
was to choose a new Avatar.

03:07.270 --> 03:08.110
Is this true?

03:12.570 --> 03:14.610
Why are you refusing
to answer her?

03:14.990 --> 03:17.240
Who are these Creators?

03:17.610 --> 03:19.280
The Earth girl spoke the truth.

03:19.450 --> 03:22.450
My internal lie detector
has never been wrong.

03:23.250 --> 03:26.080
We have suffered enough.
We must have the truth!

03:26.250 --> 03:29.000
That's right! No one tricks
Lord Furter but himself!

03:29.330 --> 03:30.590
Silence!

03:32.420 --> 03:35.260
I will not tolerate
this nonsense!

03:41.350 --> 03:43.140
The Creators...

03:44.520 --> 03:45.770
are nothing...

03:46.850 --> 03:48.600
but... ghosts...

03:51.020 --> 03:52.270
He's gone.

03:52.440 --> 03:54.030
What have we done?

04:03.540 --> 04:06.960
I'm getting way too old for these...

04:07.120 --> 04:08.670
moments of majesty.

04:09.620 --> 04:12.250
They're very overrated, you know.

04:19.800 --> 04:22.510
Are you the... Avatar?

04:23.140 --> 04:24.390
Yes.

04:26.140 --> 04:27.060
I am.

04:29.440 --> 04:33.650
But as you can see,
my reign is coming to an end.

04:35.780 --> 04:37.570
So then it's true.

04:38.150 --> 04:39.820
There is no Ultimate Prize.

04:40.360 --> 04:43.030
There is a prize, Molly,

04:43.200 --> 04:46.660
but perhaps not the prize
you had hoped for.

04:48.620 --> 04:53.210
For the good of the Galaxy,
a new Avatar must arise.

04:53.630 --> 04:57.630
A creature of immense strength
and steadfast determination.

04:58.470 --> 05:01.300
You mean the winner
of the Great Race of Oban?

05:01.680 --> 05:02.840
Yes.

05:03.090 --> 05:05.430
Indeed.
Like I before you,

05:05.600 --> 05:07.970
a mere 10,000 years
before today.

05:09.480 --> 05:11.650
Why did you lie to us?

05:11.850 --> 05:15.770
So your motivations
would not be tainted

05:15.940 --> 05:18.820
by your lust
for power and conquest.

05:29.870 --> 05:34.250
The Avatar is the guardian
and the protector of the Galaxy.

05:34.790 --> 05:37.130
It is a position
of great strength

05:37.300 --> 05:39.380
and great responsibility.

05:39.550 --> 05:42.680
One to be honored,
cherished, and protected.

05:43.260 --> 05:45.850
The final race shall
go ahead as planned,

05:46.010 --> 05:49.520
regardless of who stays in,
and who among you drops out.

05:49.680 --> 05:52.730
You have until noon
to inform me of your decisions.

06:08.370 --> 06:11.870
I don't blame you, Molly,
but you really caught me off guard

06:12.040 --> 06:14.040
with all this Creator stuff.

06:14.290 --> 06:15.540
Satis,

06:15.710 --> 06:19.250
can the Avatar
bring someone back to life?

06:21.670 --> 06:24.680
The Avatar enjoys many powers.

06:24.890 --> 06:27.720
However, no one,
not even the Avatar

06:27.890 --> 06:32.270
should ever dare to tamper
with the kingdom of the dead.

06:32.430 --> 06:33.270
Sorry.

06:36.730 --> 06:38.320
That's what I was afraid of.

06:49.030 --> 06:49.660
Eva?

06:50.160 --> 06:52.160
-Molly!
-Jordan!

06:52.660 --> 06:53.910
It's impossible.

06:54.370 --> 06:56.580
But how did you... uh...

07:08.760 --> 07:10.390
<i>Uh...</i> what's the matter?

07:12.060 --> 07:13.310
Everything.

07:35.080 --> 07:36.250
Forget it.

07:36.410 --> 07:37.960
We can never fix it.

07:38.120 --> 07:40.880
We can't leave our baby
looking like this.

07:42.550 --> 07:44.970
Come on.
Let's give it our best shot.

07:45.220 --> 07:46.800
This is the last of the last.

08:16.960 --> 08:20.630
You know, personally, I think
you'd make a great Avatar.

08:20.790 --> 08:24.380
I don't think so,
but thanks for the compliment.

08:26.970 --> 08:30.180
Molly, why did you want
the Ultimate Prize so badly?

08:34.350 --> 08:36.140
Just a crazy idea.

08:36.770 --> 08:38.600
Yeah? What was it?

08:41.350 --> 08:43.690
My mom died
when I was young,

08:43.860 --> 08:47.030
and my father
just sort of split after that.

08:47.740 --> 08:50.450
Oh, I'm sorry.
I had no idea.

08:51.030 --> 08:53.070
I thought if I could bring
my mother back to life,

08:53.240 --> 08:55.240
I could make us a family again.

08:56.450 --> 08:57.620
That was my wish.

09:02.630 --> 09:07.210
Now that that can never happen,
I just feel empty.

09:08.800 --> 09:10.720
There's no reason for me
to race anymore.

09:13.140 --> 09:14.350
I understand.

09:25.860 --> 09:27.900
We must have
a contingency plan.

09:28.110 --> 09:29.860
This is a sign
that we must pause

09:30.070 --> 09:31.360
in our march for conquest.

09:31.740 --> 09:34.870
Nonsense. We must press
forward, as always.

09:35.030 --> 09:37.700
This mission was
a complete waste of time.

09:37.870 --> 09:40.410
It would have been wiser
to keep General Kross here

09:40.620 --> 09:43.460
to supervise
the preparations for the war.

09:44.130 --> 09:47.300
Has the leader of the Eastern Hordes
already forgotten

09:47.460 --> 09:50.510
it was he who stressed
the importance of the Ultimate Prize

09:50.720 --> 09:52.220
for our defense.

09:52.930 --> 09:54.090
Take that back!

09:54.260 --> 09:57.970
Or face a challenge of strength
here in this room!

09:58.180 --> 09:59.350
Enough!

10:01.180 --> 10:05.020
How can you pretend to govern
the lmperium without eyes?

10:07.320 --> 10:10.740
Though he may not use his powers
for himself directly,

10:10.990 --> 10:13.490
the powers of the Avatar
are immense.

10:13.740 --> 10:17.120
He can influence the course
of History in more ways than one.

10:17.370 --> 10:19.790
I will win this race

10:19.950 --> 10:22.620
and become the new Avatar.

10:23.250 --> 10:26.920
And you will accept me
as your leader

10:27.090 --> 10:30.090
or die in defiance.

10:34.930 --> 10:37.510
Let them feast on that for a while.

10:38.720 --> 10:41.020
No! This won't do!

10:46.860 --> 10:48.650
It needs to be...

10:49.150 --> 10:51.030
ah... regal...

10:51.610 --> 10:53.700
-What's he doing in there?
-I'm worried.

10:53.860 --> 10:56.030
He hasn't come out
since his return.

10:59.200 --> 11:01.740
My good men,
they have laughed at me.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.870
They have despised me.

11:05.000 --> 11:08.960
But today, today your captain
will be Avatar!

11:09.380 --> 11:12.550
And the Galaxy will be our oyster!

11:12.760 --> 11:13.920
Yay!

11:26.850 --> 11:29.310
Has my quest been in vain?

11:31.980 --> 11:36.150
I so much wanted to feel
something, at least once.

11:37.240 --> 11:39.820
Centuries of study
may never be enough.

11:43.080 --> 11:46.920
And yet, with so much power...

11:48.330 --> 11:50.250
There can only be one Avatar.

11:50.420 --> 11:52.960
I could never accept
being separated from you.

11:53.670 --> 11:55.630
Have you already forgotten
our wish, Skun?

11:56.050 --> 12:00.090
Remember our kind,
scattered across the Galaxy.

12:00.800 --> 12:03.510
We've become mercenaries,
bounty hunters.

12:04.180 --> 12:08.060
Soon all shall have forgotten
what made us a people once.

12:09.690 --> 12:14.480
Who better than the Avatar
to lead us into this new golden age?

12:29.710 --> 12:33.210
You're wasting your thoughts
on this Earth girl.

12:33.800 --> 12:35.090
Be careful, my prince.

12:35.300 --> 12:38.260
It is not she that will save
our kingdom.

12:38.510 --> 12:40.340
And who will? You?

12:41.180 --> 12:44.430
If I win the race, the kingdom
will be left without an heir

12:44.600 --> 12:46.390
and will certainly collapse.

12:46.560 --> 12:50.230
If the Crogs win the race,
my parents will be freed,

12:50.600 --> 12:53.400
but we shall be the slaves
of our conquerors.

12:53.610 --> 12:56.440
There is, I'm afraid,
no other option.

12:57.900 --> 13:01.110
Not unless someone else
wins the Ultimate Prize.

13:01.450 --> 13:03.780
Someone
with a heart that's pure.

13:09.540 --> 13:11.710
Molly, it's almost noon.

13:13.960 --> 13:16.800
This is not
what I wanted to hear, Don Wei.

13:16.960 --> 13:20.840
Mr. President, it was
a shock to me as well.

13:21.180 --> 13:25.560
However, this may be
an even greater opportunity for us.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.770
Think of all we could achieve
with a human Avatar.

13:28.930 --> 13:30.100
You must get her to race.

13:30.600 --> 13:32.100
Sir, we can't!

13:32.270 --> 13:34.190
We've used her
from the beginning.

13:34.480 --> 13:37.150
She didn't even know
what she was racing for.

13:38.030 --> 13:39.900
She thought
she could use the Prize

13:40.070 --> 13:42.030
to bring her mother
back from the dead.

13:42.280 --> 13:45.030
Touching. But irrelevant.

13:45.580 --> 13:47.910
The Crogs are a threat
to all humanity.

13:48.120 --> 13:50.080
They must be eliminated.

13:51.000 --> 13:55.250
The Crogs, and whoever else
stands in our way.

13:55.710 --> 13:58.340
You will make her race
at all costs.

13:58.630 --> 14:00.300
We must win this competition!

14:06.050 --> 14:08.930
I will never force her
to race. Never!

14:09.850 --> 14:12.020
The choice is...

14:12.640 --> 14:13.480
...Eva's.

14:15.770 --> 14:19.230
I fear we can no longer trust
our friend Don Wei.

14:19.400 --> 14:21.490
Prepare to launch
the preemptive strike.

14:22.070 --> 14:23.700
We shall prevail, sir.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.620
We have no choice.

14:32.620 --> 14:34.920
Muir has not joined our party.

14:35.210 --> 14:38.210
I suppose he's dropped out.
What about you?

14:38.590 --> 14:39.550
I'm in.

14:40.460 --> 14:41.800
And I'm in!

14:42.010 --> 14:43.050
We're in.

14:43.260 --> 14:44.050
And I'm in.

14:48.050 --> 14:49.060
I'm in.

14:51.390 --> 14:52.560
I'm...

14:54.560 --> 14:55.600
Molly?

14:58.060 --> 14:59.610
I'm so out.

15:08.870 --> 15:11.290
I suggest you all do the same.

15:11.450 --> 15:14.710
None of you stand a chance
against the power of the Crogs.

15:18.630 --> 15:20.670
Molly, you can't do this.

15:20.840 --> 15:23.510
All of us must stand together
against the Crogs.

15:23.670 --> 15:25.010
If Kross becomes Avatar...

15:25.470 --> 15:28.510
I think you've switched sides
a little too easily, Aikka.

15:35.560 --> 15:36.480
You take care of it.

15:37.270 --> 15:39.060
This is no longer my fight.

15:42.020 --> 15:44.150
Pilots, prepare yourselves.

15:44.320 --> 15:47.240
The final race shall begin soon!

15:51.700 --> 15:56.040
A prince after his princess?

15:56.830 --> 16:01.170
Don't forget the fate
of your family is in my hands.

16:01.460 --> 16:02.800
No. I won't.

16:05.970 --> 16:08.010
You shall have my full support.

16:12.890 --> 16:15.770
That's it,
for better or for worse.

16:16.020 --> 16:18.230
Soon it will all be over.

16:20.810 --> 16:21.860
Harder, men!

16:22.020 --> 16:23.980
The new Avatar
won't forget you

16:24.150 --> 16:26.820
once he's taken
his rightful throne!

16:30.660 --> 16:31.740
Courage, Aikka.

16:32.450 --> 16:34.950
It is a prince's duty
to sacrifice himself

16:35.120 --> 16:37.080
for the better good
of the kingdom.

16:40.370 --> 16:43.630
Soon I will know what it feels
to be like you, little ones.

16:44.550 --> 16:46.510
A creature of flesh and blood.

16:58.180 --> 16:59.640
Hail, Kross!

16:59.810 --> 17:01.190
Leader of the Crogs!

17:03.270 --> 17:04.940
Prepare the Armada.

17:05.110 --> 17:07.820
In a few hours, I, the Avatar,

17:07.990 --> 17:10.950
will lead you to victory
against the humans.

17:14.870 --> 17:17.040
<i>Molly, you can't do this.</i>

17:17.290 --> 17:19.710
<i>All of us must stand
together against the Crogs.</i>

17:19.870 --> 17:22.080
<i>If Kross becomes Avatar...</i>

17:22.290 --> 17:24.380
Am I doing the right thing?

17:26.300 --> 17:27.920
Of course I am.

17:28.090 --> 17:29.970
Who would want to be
master of the universe

17:30.130 --> 17:31.840
for the next 10,000 years?

17:33.800 --> 17:36.100
I was never meant to be
part of this team.

17:36.430 --> 17:38.640
All I wanted was to have
a family again,

17:39.270 --> 17:40.730
and start to live.

17:40.890 --> 17:42.350
Finally live!

18:01.330 --> 18:04.080
Wait! Molly!
Set that ship down immediately!

18:06.630 --> 18:08.960
No, Jordan!
We can still win this race!

18:14.140 --> 18:15.800
We're alive! We're alive!

18:18.220 --> 18:19.600
I said, get lost!

18:25.810 --> 18:26.650
Yeah, she did it!

18:36.660 --> 18:38.370
We had fun, didn't we?

18:45.670 --> 18:46.960
I guess the fun's over.

19:02.520 --> 19:05.100
You know, Molly,
maybe this is for the better.

19:05.270 --> 19:07.100
I wouldn't want to ride
in that thing, anyway.

19:14.780 --> 19:16.030
It's so beautiful.

19:18.160 --> 19:20.700
Hurry up, Jordan. We're late.

19:21.120 --> 19:22.790
You mean we're...

19:23.410 --> 19:25.210
We're gonna race?

19:26.920 --> 19:29.790
Hey! Wait for me,
master of the Galaxy!

19:30.380 --> 19:32.800
I'm only racing
to stop Kross, got it?

19:32.960 --> 19:34.300
I have no desire to become...

19:34.470 --> 19:37.180
Yeah, yeah, whatever,
Miss Avatar.

19:44.100 --> 19:45.850
Look, Koji.
Our baby's taking off.

19:46.020 --> 19:47.480
Taking off on its last race.

19:52.270 --> 19:54.190
The stage is set.

19:54.400 --> 19:58.200
The curtain may now rise.

20:06.160 --> 20:07.420
We've not been detected, sir.

20:07.580 --> 20:08.960
They're not at their battle stations.

20:09.540 --> 20:10.670
That's perfect.

20:10.840 --> 20:12.000
Ready all ships!

20:12.170 --> 20:14.630
The time has come to avenge
our fathers!

20:15.300 --> 20:17.170
Fire at will!

20:29.520 --> 20:30.520
Eva.

20:31.230 --> 20:33.270
Eva, you don't have to do this.

20:33.690 --> 20:35.360
We can go home now.

20:35.570 --> 20:38.570
I promise, you and I
will never be separated again.

20:44.910 --> 20:46.830
I hope I can live
to see that day,

20:47.120 --> 20:49.750
but for the moment,
I've got something to finish.

20:50.000 --> 20:52.790
There's a lot more than just us
to worry about here.

20:58.760 --> 20:59.970
Good luck, Eva.

21:01.300 --> 21:03.470
Your mother would be so proud.

21:18.530 --> 21:22.620
After 10,000 years,
my time has come.

21:22.950 --> 21:26.870
Revenge is mine!
